  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "CHANGED\n- Android binding updated to `Kebechet.Maui.RevenueCat.Android` 10.16.1 (RevenueCat Android SDK 10.1.2 -> 10.16.1). Notable upstream fixes: BillingClient connection moved off the main thread, showInAppMessages guarded against BillingClient runtime crashes, several OutOfMemory fixes around cached offerings responses. Full changelog: https://github.com/RevenueCat/purchases-android/releases\n- iOS binding updated to `Kebechet.Maui.RevenueCat.iOS` 5.83.1 (RevenueCat iOS SDK 5.72.0 -> 5.83.1). Notable upstream changes: Test Store free-trial support, Test Store no longer logs misleading App Store/StoreKit messages, and a T-SAN memory-alignment crash fix. Full changelog: https://github.com/RevenueCat/purchases-ios/releases",
